OL,3,GNEWSA'Campsite ban could be the end of
OL,4,Aour business'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer fears plans to tighten rules
OL,7,Ffor pop-up campsites in a national park
OL,8,Fcould spell the end of her business.
OL,10,FThe Lake District National Park
OL,11,FAuthority (LDNPA) wants to make it
OL,12,Fcompulsory for temporary campsites to
OL,13,Frequire planning permission. Current
OL,14,Frules allow sites operating for fewer
OL,15,Fthan 60 days to be set up by simply
OL,16,Fnotifying the authority.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40102
SC,0002
