OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F401A1793687247
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Campsite ban could be the end of
OL,4,Aour business'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuby Cardiff runs Newlands Valley
OL,7,FCampsite, near Keswick, during the
OL,8,Fsummer to supplement income from her
OL,9,FKeskadale Farm. She said the ban would
OL,10,F"strip away a crucial source of income"
OL,11,Ffrom farmers who depend on
OL,12,Fdiversification "for their survival".
OL,14,FThe LDNPA said the proposal aimed to
OL,15,F"prevent unneighbourly or harmful
OL,16,Fsites".
